==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 250,000 and increases by 50,000 with each stage.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Zeus (Enemy)|Super Zeus]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Heracrist (Enemy)|Heracrist]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Shaman Khan (Enemy)|Shaman Khan]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*5 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup> delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1800f</sup>.

